The Atelier platform can provide quick access to reliable information through its retrieval layer with hybrid search capabilities and grounded response with source citations. It supports daily activities of professionals by assisting in tasks such as drafting professional documents and handling client files.

To fit into existing practices, our API-first approach allows for seamless integration with the firm's production tools, including accounting-production software, payroll software, document management / GED, and electronic-invoicing / dematerialisation environment. 

We can ensure hosting on SecNumCloud-qualified infrastructure or equivalent through our partnership with OuraneCloud, which provides a Sovereign tier that is SecNumCloud-qualified, EU-only, and renewable-powered.

For performance and availability, our platform's containerisation using Kubernetes allows for horizontal scaling to meet seasonal peak loads. The median latency of 1.3 seconds and p95 latency below 2.5 seconds ensure responsive performance. 

Additionally, our hosting options include a High-availability premium tier with additional redundancy and dedicated inference capacity, which can be considered if higher throughput and peak resilience are required.

